# The card-sandbox bootstrap's build output.
#
# Its own directory rather than `dist/sandbox/`, which the repository root
# already ignores, because the app build runs with `emptyOutDir` and would wipe
# it. `npm run build` orders the two builds correctly, but a bare `vite build`
# afterwards would silently delete the bootstrap and leave a `dist/` that looks
# complete and cannot run a single card. A separate directory cannot be emptied
# by accident.
dist-sandbox/
